<title>ITALY: Stet /Telecom share ratio set.</title>
<headline>Stet /Telecom share ratio set.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The share swap ratio for Italian state telecoms holding Stet's merger with telecoms operator Telecom Italia is set at 1.8 ordinary Telecom shares for one ordinary Stet share, the two boards announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The ratio will be 1.72 Telecom savings shares for every Stet savings share.</p>
<p>The boards announced in a statement that to carry out the operation Stet plans to increase its present capital of 5.281 trillion lire by a maximum of 2.170 trillion lire. The newly issued shares will have a nominal value of 1,000 lire each.</p>
</text>
